agent.prompt:
Open this product page in your browser: {{url}}
The shopper's size is {{size}}. Pick that size on the page the way a shopper would (US men's unless the page says otherwise). Report only what the page shows: is size {{size}} available to buy right now, and what is the price for it (amount and currency)?
Return these records for ref {{ref}}:
1. a claim with attr {{attr}}, label = "Size " followed by the size, value "In stock", "Sold out" or "Not listed", status ok (or uncertain if the page is unclear, with a short note why), basis "live";
2. an offer for that size (oid built from the ref and size, variant.label = "Size " followed by the size, seller = the store's name, availability, price.kind "regular" or "sale", handoff.url = the page URL), only if a price is shown.
Use prov.source = the store's host name (no www), prov.url = the page URL, ttl_s 21600, class "live". Decline cookie banners. Do not add to cart, sign in or accept any terms.
